## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to design privacy-conscious analytics with on-device processing and reliable background uploads.

## Key Concepts

- On-device data collection and consent management
- Core Data vs SQLite schema design for Events and Aggregates
- Encryption in transit and at rest, Keychain storage
- Background transfers with URLSession, backoff and jitter
- Data integrity: retries, deduping, corruption handling

